<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2OTI - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwopo Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa OTIMOTI</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Otimoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Oti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwupu Ungwopo Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Igbomo mizhikembo iyi Ɔpɔlu a ka kwupu ungwu Otimoti uwu kwonze mbala kwupu ungwu Otayitusu akwɛyi o gba o yi wu mo akwɛyi o ko ta wu mu ugu mu Oromu. Akwu mu ugu mɔmɔ gba a ka kwupu kwɔlɛ laa Otimoti le.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔpɔlu a ka kwupu kwɔlɛ kaa la ta Otimoti amasa le kwuwongu Otimoti akwu umbwama wu mbala uwɛri wu mu imbwaluma. Idu iyimo gba akwu reshi ingyi iso shɛ mu kwupu kwɔlɛ le. Ɔpɔlu a ta Otimoti amasa a gba kɔ wu ɛnwu ma tee la kyakpɔɔ mu anu itama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, la rima gbagiri mu ongbulolo uwu Iso Iyeshi ɛlɛ izɔma, le wo ɛduma wu iyi u zɔ kiya mbala u ta anu iyi Okrasi marimari kyoo laa inyashi imama mbala itomo iyi enzu.</para>
  <para style="ip">A za wu te la ngbɛndu kaa le kyo mu lɔɔmbu irimo undu umbwa undu bɔkɔ lu ka la enzu kiya kinyinyi ingyesheshi mo ba lu tutu enzu umba bɔkɔ ɔ ngbɛ alu umba nzu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu ɛlɛ lɛɛbi, o lolo Otimoti iyi luzɛ undu eshi undu Ɔpɔlu, ikwidufulo wu, idu iyimo wu, idɛnyi iyi e yi yi, idiyimo, mbala inyashi iyi o lo wu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ipwɔma mbala Ɛnwu Ikama (1.3—2.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Amasa Itama mbala Iye malu (2.14—4.5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ewo Iyi Ɔpɔlu E Yi Mayi (4.6-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama Iyi Iso (4.19-22)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Imi Ɔpɔlu, mi kwu uzilɔ uwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mu inyama iyi Edego-ala. Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋa mi te kaa la mi so enzu te Ukpo e siso e shi mɛzhi te kinzu ki yi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔɔ mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Kwupu kwɔlɛ mi ka ŋa umɛ mi Otimoti:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TI 1:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Mi lɛ Ukpo ete nzu mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Ɔkwu nzu te esheshi wu, eyembembyi wu mbala idigbomo wu li yi mbala ŋa.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Ka Otimoti Ɛnwu ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Mi gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ imi mbala asɔkwu mi ki mbwalu la egbo ikpɛnyi awu. Mi gbɛlɛ wu ɛnyi ta bɔkɔ mi koko mi lolo ŋɔ mu Ukpo ilɛma mi, la utu la ɔnu. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Gba mi lolo oga uwu ŋɔ lo, mi gyi te la mi ma ŋa kaa ɔnyɛ mi la nyɔlɔma. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Mi lolo ikwu idu fulo ŋɔ ikpakara iyi ŋɔ yi yi awu, iyi bɔkɔ unyɔku ŋɔ Ɔlɔyisi mbala ɛnɛ ŋɔ Oyunisi o yi yi keyi dɛ awu. Mi nyama te uŋɔ ŋɔ yi yi tete. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ mi lolo ŋɔ kaa fya ɔyi uwu rɛshi ingyi ɛduma iyeshi ma ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi ŋɔ kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi fulo ŋɔ ewo mu reshi awu. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Moo Ukpo e wo nzu te la ki kwu enzu umba o yi iyi mo, Ukpo ba e shi nzu ekpasu iyi kwundu wu kaa la ki yi idɛnyi i yi enzu kaa la ki yi ɛnwu nzu ma.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ki wo lovya undu anu itama iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mo, naa lovya unda mi, u gbo ugu ugyi kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mo. Uŋɔ ba kyo mbala mi mu wɔnu imama iyi anu itama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Ukpo ee shi ŋɔ ekpasu kaa wo yi. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Ukpo a sa nzu ma akwɛyi a ya nzu ma kaa la ki kwu enzu wu wa sɛsɛ, akwu kwuwongu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki wo mo, akwu kwuwongu igyima wu mbala esheshi wu. Esheshi ɛlɛ i zɛ mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi dɛ ishi Ukpo e wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />kekelele ba i ta nduu kwudu kwuwongu ibomo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi usama nzu, uwu bɔkɔ a ngbɛ ekpasu iyi lukwu ma akwɛyi e shi nzu ɛnwu iyi bɔkɔ i kpomo mo kwuwongu ki nyama la Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Ukpo a ŋa mi kaa la mi kwu uzilɔ mbala u zɔ kiya wu kaa la mi zɛ ilɔ wu iyesheshi. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Akwu kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba mi yi mu wɔnu imama le. Imi ba mi wo lovya mo, kwuwongu mi yitu iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ mi fulo egbo ma wu, imi mi fulo egbo te Ukpo e do te e shi rito ingyi iso wu nzhii ba kwɔfyi ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a ba gbama. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Ra la ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ mi zɔ ŋɔ awu, kaa lakwu izɔma iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ mbwalu yi mbala ikwu idu lu fulo mbala idɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e shi ŋɔ awu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Mu ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yi ma nzu awu, gbo ilɔ iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ o lo ŋɔ mu kwuwo awu ma.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Uŋɔ ŋɔ yitu te onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya, ikyo Ofagelu mbala Amogeni o renya o shi mi. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Ukpo le shi kwogba ungwu Onesiforu iyeshi wu, kwuwongu a na mi ewo epo kwuyengwunanguna. E wo lovya kwuwongu o ta mi mu ugu ugyi mo. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Kwuye ungwunanguna ungwu bɔkɔ e bo mu Oromu, a kagyi mi ngbɛɛ nzhii ba e fye mi mo. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Ukpo la ma eyembembyi wu ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ombu izɔma wu! Uŋɔ ŋɔ yitu marimari iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ e wo mi mu Ɛfɛsɔ.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Osozha Uwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi Uwu Kwuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ uŋɔ Otimoti umɛ mi, kɔma mu esheshi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Apula iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ pwa mi siso meka yi mu eyi iyi enzu riba, zɔ yi enzu umba kwuyi umba bɔkɔ o domo te ɔ zɔ yi enzu umbafo tete. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Yidu mu inyashi imama mbala mi kyamate osozha uwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi tayi. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu osozha e kyo mu ɛduma iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu asozha mo mo kwuwongu a gyi te le wo iyi bɔkɔ adakwogba wu a gyi. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Tete, gba onzu e yi mu kenzu itumo unga enya irima, a fya rigbɛ ingyirimo mo gba a mbwalu ɛrama iyi enya irima ɛnyi mo. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Ɔnɛgba uwu kuyi gba ishoshi te lakwu onzu uwu kwonze uwu bɔkɔ e ri kule ungwu ewiri iyi utu wu le. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Otimoti, ngbɛndu mu iso iyi bɔkɔ mi ye ŋɔ mu isomo le, Ukpo le shi ŋɔ kaa zɔngɔma iso mi ɛlɛ ma.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Uŋɔ Otimoti, koko kaa lolo te Ukpo e yi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mo mu kuvɔ, Ɔzhizɔsi ele a wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Ɔsu Odevidi. Ɛlɛ gba akwu ilɔ mi iyeshi iyi mi koko mi so yi le. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />A kwu kwuwo yi gba mi yi mu inyashi imama nzhii ba o lo mi ɛyɛ kyamate mi wo iyira tayi le. Iso iyi Ukpo ba i yi mu ɛyɛ mo. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi bɔ ɛmi kepo midu te mi yidu mu inyashi iyinayina imama kwuwongu enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa mba kaa umba tete lo nyama la Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi akwɛyi o fya isama ma akwɛyi o fya inzumbɛku iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Iso ɛlɛ akwu iso iyi ongbulolo te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Gba ki kpomo mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">kinzu tete ki gba la iyimo mbala wu;<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />gba ki yidu iyi inyashi imama kwuwo wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">kinzu tete ki rɛsu mbala wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Gba ba ki towo wu mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">uwu tete e towo nzu mo;<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Gba ki wo iyi bɔkɔ a zɔ te la ki wo mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">uwu ee wo iyi bɔkɔ a zɔ te ee wo nzu, kwuwongu uwu a mu angba mo.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onzu U Wo Ɛduma Iyi Bɔkɔ Ukpo A Gyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Otimoti, uŋɔ koko kaa lolo wa mbwalu ɛzu ɛlɛ. Za mba te kwuwongu Ukpo, lo ri kaambu mu iluma iyi iso mo; moo kaambu kɛlɛ ke yi kwuyi mo, ka ngbɛ enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu alu ingbɛma ɛdɔma. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Bɔ kuyi mu ɛduma iwomo kaa zɔ ɛŋɔ mu idu iyi Ukpo te ŋɔ kwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a nyama la wu, onzu u wo ɛduma uwu lovya lu wo wu mo mo, onzu u zɔ ɛzu iyi ongbulolo. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Ki kyo mu eza ibama iyi umbwa mbala enzu mo, kwuwongu eza ɛlɛ te i shi enzu o lafya la ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Iso mbo ɛnyi i yama kyamate kwɔshinakpa ungwu kwu shi ɛnwu kpɛkpɛyi i pwofya tayi. Enzu wepo umba bɔkɔ o zɔ ɛzu ɛlɛ te gba akwu Amɛniyɔ mbala Ofiletu le. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Enzu mbɔlɛ o lafya la ongbulolo, o zɔ te Ukpo e yi wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mo mu kwuvɔ-ɔ, kwuwo ngwɔlɛ o shi wa mbwalu umbafo o lafya la Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Tetete, ɔla uwu Ukpo ba u rima ngiri. O ka ɛzu mawu te: &lt;&lt;Ukpo e yitu iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu umba wu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi, mega a lafya la ira iwomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Mu kwogba ungwu onzu uwakwu o fya apula ikikɔ ikikɔ, iyifo o wo yi mu egolu, iyifo ba o wo yi mu ɛwɛyi, iyifo tete o wo yi mu lo mbo; iyifo o wo ɛduma iyesheshi ma yi, iyifo ba o wo ɛduma iyi umbwa ma yi. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Gba onzu a sɛ ɛnwu ma mu apula iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ akwiyi ira, onzu awu e yi kyamate apula iyi bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma iyi kwuyi ma yi, onzu awu akwu onzu ɔkɛrikɛri, akwɛyi ada uwu kwogba wu e wo ɛduma mawu akwɛyi o du wu te e yi ɛnwu ma iyi ɛduma iyeshi iyinayina byi ŋa.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Uŋɔ Otimoti rima mbaa apula iyira iyi bɔkɔ ekolobiya o wo yi, uŋɔ kpapyi mu iyeshi iwomo, uŋɔ kwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ enzu o kwidu o fulo mawu, pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu akwɛyi ŋɔ mu oloto mbala enzu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o gbo Ukpo oya la egbo mbo pɛriri. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Uŋɔ ki ri kaambu unga umbwa mbala erendo mbala enzu mo, kwuwongu ŋɔ yitu te kaambu irimo kɛlɛ te ke bo la itumo. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Onzu uwu e wo ɛduma iyi Ukpo ba e tumo mo; i shoshi te lakwu onzu uwu egbo mɛzhi mbala uwewe, onzu uwu e do enzu ɛzu izɔma ɔnyɛnyɛ, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yidu mbala uwewe. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ a nyama la iso wu mo, la zɔ yi mba bɛbɛtɛ, igboshimo mu iwomo wu tayi Ukpo ee shi mbo kapa te lo ta mɛzhi akwɛyi ii shi o zɔngɔma ongbulolo mo. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Akwɛyi i shi mbo o byi egbo ɔnyɛnyɛ ŋa akwɛyi o ta mu kwuda ungwu onzu uwoyi fo, uwu bɔkɔ e yi mbo mo akwɛyi a ramba e wo enye wu kaa lo wo iyi bɔkɔ uwu a gyi awu.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Inzumbira Iyi Kwuye Ungwu Ibomo Iyi Kwudu Kwɔlɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Otimoti, mi gyi te kaa yitu te: Inzumbira iyɛku i nyɔ kwuyengwu ibomo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Kwuye kwɔngwu enzu oo kwu wa gyi ɛmbɛmba kɛɛkyi, oo kwu wa kpoluku undu eduwo, mbala ibɔma, mbala ɛnwu ikwumo, mbala ari ikpama, enzu o lo umbete mbo mbala umbanyimba ma fo, enzu o ngbede mo, o lo iso iyi Ukpo mo mo. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Enzu o yi idɛnyi iyi enzu umbafo fo, o gbayi o kpa enzu mo, akwu wa tutu enzu, o yi ɛnwu mba ma kego mo, enzu o yi ira, o gyi iyeshi mo, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />enzu oo kwu wa rutu uwesu, oo kwu wa kakara, oo kwu enzu umba ibɔma, oo gyi ɔnyɛ o ka Ukpo ma, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />O zɔ te o yi Ukpo, ɔbulɛ o towo ekpasu wu mo. Zɛ gboo mbaa enzu mbamba tayi.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Enzu mbɔlɛ te gba o fye mu agba iyi enzu kyokyokyo kaa lo kyoro ekokpayi erendo umba bɔkɔ ingbomo i nyɔlɔ mba ma awu mo. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Eko mbɔlɛ te iyɔkpɔɔ o yi mu iyinayina ivɔngɔma, tetete, o zɔngɔma ototo mbala angba ma mo. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Kyamate Ozhenesi mbala Ozhambirisi o towo iso iyi Omosisi ma mekyi awu, tatayi gba enzu mbɔlɛ o towo ongbulolo mo le. Egbo mbo akwiyira, o kyo mbo o wama mu kwogba ungwu Ukpo mo. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Tetete, o do te o re shaaru la luzɛ mba ndɔlɛ mo. Iyi bɔkɔ i du Ozhemisi mbala Ozhambirisi mekyi awu gba i du enzu mbɔlɛ le tete; o re shaaru dɛ mo, akwɛyi onzu uwunawuna a da erendo mbo ma.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu A Ka Otimoti Ɛnwu Ma Te Le Wo Ɛduma Iyi Ukpo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Otimoti, uŋɔ ba ŋɔ yi ɛzu iyi bɔkɔ mi zɔ lɛɛbi, ŋɔ yi luzɛ mi, ŋɔ yi egbo mi, ŋɔ yi ikwu idu fulo mi, mbala idu iyimo mi, mbala idɛnyi ipwumo mi, mbala idu kwɔku mi, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />mbala inyashi imama mi, mbala apula ikikɔ ikikɔ iyi bɔkɔ i du mi mu Atiyɔki mbala Ikɔniyɔ mbala Olisitira, inyashi iyi bɔkɔ mi ma mɔmɔ. Tetete, Ukpo a wa mi ma ma yi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Ee, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a gyi te la zɛ luzɛ undu bɔkɔ Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi a gyi, o lo wu inyashi, <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />enzu umbira mbala wakyoro enzu ba ira mba iwomo i kyomo. Ɔ gyakpɔɔ mu enzu ikyoromo, umba tete enzu o kyoro mbo mo. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Otimoti, apula iyi ŋɔ vɔngɔ akwɛyi ŋɔ nyama la yi awu ba, ra yi kpakiri tayi, moo ŋɔ yi enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɔ ŋɔ yi awu moo? <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Uŋɔ ŋɔ yitu te ngbaa kwuyengwu ŋɔ kwu umɛshɛri gba ŋɔ yitu iyi iso iyi Ukpo le, te onzu uwu akwu idu wu e fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gba Ukpo a sa wu ma le. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Iso iyi Ukpo lɛɛbi akwu ɛnyɔ iyi bɔkɔ e fu mu egbo iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ ɔ ka iso ɛnyi awu. Inyi gba o ra yi kaa lɔ zɔ enzu ongbulolo le, kaa lo tu mbo mo, lɔ nɔngɔ mba ma kwuyengwu o ngbomo, kaa lo kyo lɔ zɔ mba luzɛ undu toto undu lu she la Ukpo le, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />kaa onzu u mbwalu Ukpo la fya iyitu mbala ekpasu kaa le wo ɛduma iyeshi iyinayina iyi Ukpo a gyi.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Kwuwongwu Ukpo mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ a ba zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi la reyi mbala umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o awu, uwu bɔkɔ a ba gbama kwuyengwu ɛsu irimo wu awu, mi ta ŋa okpa te: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Rima mu anu itama iyi iso ɛlɛ ma marimari lutu lɔnu; gba onzu e wo ɔnyɛ mo, nɔngɔ wu ma, kpa wu ɛyi, ka wu ɛnwu ma. Zɔ wu ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mu egbo mɛzhi. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Moo kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma ungwu bɔkɔ enzu o shi kwɔlu mu ɛzɔ iyi kwuyi fo. Akwɛyi o wo iyi bɔkɔ egbo mbo i gyi, o kpala wa zɔ kiya ribariba ɛlu la ɛmba akwɛyi o so mbo iyi bɔkɔ umba o gyi te lo pwa le. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />O to alu mba ma mbaa ongbulolo akwɛyi o shi alu mba mbaa ɛza iyi ɛdɔ mba. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Otimoti, uŋɔ ba yi ɛŋɔ kwuwo kwuyengwunanguna, yidu mu kinɔ imama, uŋɔ wo ɛduma iyi onzu u tanu, wo ɛduma iyi Ukpo bɔkɔ e shi ŋɔ le lɛɛbi.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Moo mi ra la kwunyɔ mi mi shi kyamate embyi mba isabɔ tayi-e; kwuyengwu mi lafya la kwudu kwɔlɛ kwu ndama fo. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Mi kiri ewa marimari-a, mi ri ɛnya mi mbwama-a, mi ra la iso iyi Ukpo nzhii ba mi mbwa ɛduma mi ma. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Kekelele te, rigbɛ ingyi bɔkɔ o shi onzu uwu a zɛ luzɛ undu ototo ingyi ɛnuma ri rigbo mi, Ɔkwu uwu bɔkɔ akwu u zɔ ombu uwu ototo awu e shi mi le mɔnu mawu, akwu Imi kɛɛkyi mo, e kyo e shi enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o ri gbo la igbama wu tete.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔpɔlu A Za La Otimoti Te Le Bo Le Du Wu Efyefya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Otimoti gyakpɔ ka bo ka du mi efyefya, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Moo Odimasi a lu mi afyima a ka mu Otesalonika kwuwongu bɔkɔ a nyangba iyi apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ ma. Ɔkirisɛsi ba a ka mu Ogalatiya, Ɔtayitɔ ba a ka mu Odamatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Oluku kɛɛkyi gba e yi mbala mi munɛ le. Omaki la zɛ mbala ŋa ka le bo, moo a mbwa mi ma gyɔɔ mɔgɔ wu ɛduma mi. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Mi lɔ Otakiku ma mu Ɛfɛsɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Kwuye ungwu ŋɔ nyɔ, za mi la origa uwu okpaki uwu bɔkɔ mi lu wu afyima mba Okapusu mu Oturowa awu, mbala ekpo iyi abwa iyi mi ka ɛzu ma yi awu.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alɛkizanda onzu u ndo kwondo awu e wo mi iyira gyɔɔ. Ukpo a wa wu kwusa ma mu iyi bɔkɔ e wo awu. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Uŋɔ tete gboshoshi mbala wu, moo a gyi iso iyi Ukpo mo gyɔɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Kwuye ungwu mi ka mbaa ombu ifumo mu Oromu iyi kwonze awu, onzu ukpɛnyi te a kama mbala mi kaa lakwu u uzɔgɔ mi mo, enzu lɛɛbi o lu mi afyima. Ukpo la gba yi la kpa mba. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a mbwa mi ma akwɛyi e shi mi ekpasu akwɛyi mi mbwa ɛlɔgbulɔ ɛlɛ izɛma la enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwu Azhu mo lɛɛbi. Ɔzhizɔsi ba a wa mi ma mu kenzu unga abaga mbɔlɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a wa mi ma mu ira iyi i gyi te li du mi lɛɛbi akwɛyi a wa mi ma e re mi mu kwogba wu moshi mu oloto. Iduma la kwiyi Ukpo iyɔkpɔɔ ba iyɔkpɔɔ. Ami.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma Imbwambwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Gbɛlɛ Opirisila mbala Akwila mbala enzu umba kwogba ungwu Onesiforu ɛnyi. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erasitu e yi mu Ɔkɔrɛti, Otirofimu ba mi lu wu afyima mu ɔmilɛtu. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Gyakpɔ kaa bo munɛ dɛ ishi kwuyengwu okpakyi lakwu bo. Oyubulu mbala Ɔpudɛ mbala Olayinu mbala Okilawudiya mbala ɛmɛ umbɛnɛ lɛɛbi o ye ŋɔ mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi le yi mbala ŋa. Ukpo le shi ŋɔ iyeshi.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>